OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Alice Smith
OL,6,     F5/5. Donald Macleod dives into
OL,7,     FSmith's final years and explores
OL,8,     Fher last orchestral works, with
OL,9,     Fguests Ian Graham-Jones and Leanne
OL,10,     FLangley.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FKatie welcomes composer Dani
OL,13,     FHoward and mezzo-soprano Niamh
OL,14,     FO'Sullivan to In Tune.
OL,15,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,16,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Fsoundscape of classical
OL,18,     Ffavourites, including music by
OL,19,     FBach, Barber, Mahler and Bruckner.
